    "s_how": {
      "x": 0, "y": -300, "w": 440, "fill": "blue",
      "text": "HOW TO REVIEW\nEvery screen is one artboard (390 x 844). Press Play on any screen, then tap through: the buttons are linked, so you can walk the whole flow from Splash to Chat.\nScreens follow your Flutter designs (orange brand, Inter, hard-shadow inputs) with the Hinge-style additions we agreed: prompts, likes on a photo or prompt with a comment, 25 likes a day, 4 to 6 photos."
    },
    "s_dec1": {
      "x": 500, "y": -300, "w": 440, "fill": "orange",
      "text": "DECISIONS FOR YOU (1/2)\n1. Four tabs (Discover, Liked You, Chats, Profile). The Flutter app had five; Discover and People are merged.\n2. Theme: Cream and ember (option B), chosen to be easier on the eyes. Orange is now only for buttons, hearts, badges and progress; screens are cream or warm white. Every text pair passes 4.5:1.\n3. Gender step has no emoji; icons are line icons.\n4. Terms, Privacy and Community Guidelines pages are not designed yet."
    },
    "s_dec2": {
      "x": 1000, "y": -300, "w": 440, "fill": "orange",
      "text": "DECISIONS FOR YOU (2/2)\n5. Read receipts: Off by default (Settings, Privacy).\n6. Liked You shows everyone who liked you in v1. Seeing them all is the natural paid feature later.\n7. Prompt wording is placeholder copy; we need a library of about 30.\n8. Match Note, Standouts, Roses and voice prompts are not designed (fast follow or later).\n9. Photo and prompt content shown here is placeholder art, not real people."
    },
    "s_phase": {
      "x": 1500, "y": -300, "w": 440, "fill": "green",
      "text": "PHASE 0 vs PHASE 1\nPhase 0 (launch): sign in with email code. The Phone tab on the sign-in screen is shown as 'Soon'.\nPhase 1: SMS provider and DLT registration, then the Phone tab goes live (artboard 03b). Nothing else in the flow changes, because both use the same 6-digit code screen."
    }
  },
